ser-output .infobox-table{display:table!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>caption{display:table-caption!important}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table>tbody{display:table-row-group}body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table th,body.skin--responsive .mw-parser-output .infobox-table td{padding-left:inherit;padding-right:inherit}}</style><table class=\"infobox width: 25em; vevent haudio\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-above summary album\" style=\"font-style: italic; color: inherit; background-color: burlywood; font-size: 125%;\">The Berlin Concerts</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-image\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Eric_Dolphy_The_Berlin_Concerts.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/5/5e/Eric_Dolphy_The_Berlin_Concerts.jpg/250px-Eric_Dolphy_The_Berlin_Concerts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"248\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5e/Eric_Dolphy_The_Berlin_Concerts.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"317\" data-file-height=\"314\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-header description\" style=\"color: #202122;background-color: burlywood\"><a href=\"/wiki/Album#Live\" title=\"Album\">Live album</a>&#32;by <div class=\"contributor\" style=\"display:inline\"><a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Dolphy\" title=\"Eric Dolphy\">Eric Dolphy</a></div></th></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Released</th><td class=\"infobox-data published\">1978</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Recorded</th><td class=\"infobox-data plainlist\">August 30, 1961</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Venues</th><td class=\"infobox-data\">Berlin, Germany</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Genre</th><td class=\"infobox-data category hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Jazz\" title=\"Jazz\">jazz</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\">Labels</th><td class=\"infobox-data hlist\"><a href=\"/wiki/Inner_City_Records\" title=\"Inner City Records\">Inner City Records</a><small>&#160;IC 3017</small><br /><a href=\"/wiki/Enja_Records\" title=\"Enja Records\">Enja Records</a><small>&#160;SFX-10049~50</small></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><i><b>The Berlin Concerts</b></i> is a two-LP live album by <a href=\"/wiki/Eric_Dolphy\" title=\"Eric Dolphy\">Eric Dolphy</a>. It was recorded on August 30, 1961, at two separate venues in Berlin, Germany, and was released by <a href=\"/wiki/Inner_City_Records\" title=\"Inner City Records\">Inner City Records</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Enja_Records\" title=\"Enja Records\">Enja Records</a> in 1978.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-discog&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-discog-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-liner&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-liner-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The album was recorded during Dolphy's second visit to Europe,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and documents two <a href=\"/wiki/S%C3%BCdwestfunk\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Südwestfunk\">Südwestfunk</a> (SWF) sessions. Four of the tracks (\"<a href=\"/wiki/Hot_House_(composition)\" title=\"Hot House (composition)\">Hot House</a>\", \"When Lights Are Low\", \"<a href=\"/wiki/Hi-Fly_(Randy_Weston_song)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Hi-Fly (Randy Weston song)\">Hi-Fly</a>\", and \"<a href=\"/wiki/I%27ll_Remember_April_(song)\" title=\"I&#39;ll Remember April (song)\">I'll Remember April</a>\" (mistitled as \"I'll Remember You\")) were recorded at the Club Jazz Salon. The remaining tracks (\"G.W.\" (mistitled as \"Geewee\"), \"<a href=\"/wiki/God_Bless_the_Child_(Billie_Holiday_song)\" title=\"God Bless the Child (Billie Holiday song)\">God Bless the Child</a>\", and \"245\" (mistitled as \"The Meeting\")) were recorded at the Funkturm Exhibition Hall. The recordings feature Dolphy on alto sax, bass clarinet, and flute, <a href=\"/wiki/Benny_Bailey\" title=\"Benny Bailey\">Benny Bailey</a> on trumpet, Pepsi Auer on piano, <a href=\"/wiki/George_Joyner\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"George Joyner\">George Joyner</a> on bass, and Buster Smith on drums.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-discog&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-discog-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Reception\">Reception</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=The_Berlin_Concerts&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Reception\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable floatright\" style=\"width:24.2em;font-size:88%;text-align:center;margin:0.5em 0 0.5em 1em;padding:0;border-spacing:0\"><caption style=\"font-size:115%\">Professional ratings</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"col\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;color:#202122;background:#d1dbdf;font-size:100%\">Review scores</th></tr><tr><th scope=\"col\">Source</th><th scope=\"col\">Rating</th></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><a href=\"/wiki/AllMusic\" title=\"AllMusic\">AllMusic</a></td><td style=\"text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\" title=\"4/5 stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"4/5 stars\"><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/40px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"108\" data-file-height=\"110\" /></span></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Star\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Star_full.svg/20px-Star_full.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign