=Da+Capo&amp;rft.date=1971&amp;rft.aulast=Simosko&amp;rft.aufirst=Vladimir&amp;rft.au=Tepperman%2C+Barry&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Berlin+Concerts\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFSimoskoTepperman1971\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Simosko, Vladimir; Tepperman, Barry (1971). <i>Eric Dolphy: A Musical Biography &amp; Discography</i>. Da Capo. p.&#160;114.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Eric+Dolphy%3A+A+Musical+Biography+%26+Discography&amp;rft.pages=114&amp;rft.pub=Da+Capo&amp;rft.date=1971&amp;rft.aulast=Simosko&amp;rft.aufirst=Vladimir&amp;rft.au=Tepperman%2C+Barry&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AThe+Berlin+Concerts\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-allmusic-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-allmusic_5-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-allmusic_5-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFYanow\" class=\"citation web cs1\">Yanow, Scott. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.allmusic.com/album/berlin-concerts-mw0000690008\">\"Eric Dolphy: The Berlin Concerts\"</a>. <i>AllMusic</i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">February 12,</span> 2022</span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=unknown&amp;rft.jtitle=AllMusic&amp;rft.atitle=Eric+Dolphy%3A+The+Berlin+Concerts&amp;rft.aulast=Yanow&amp;rft.aufirst=Scott&amp;rft&#95;id=https